1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,783
Two board games.

2
00:00:01,803 --> 00:00:03,436
Open a link, and play.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,919
Shadow Hunt and Game of Trades.

4
00:00:07,939 --> 00:00:09,713
Both run in a browser tab.

5
00:00:09,733 --> 00:00:13,094
Pass one screen around the table, or play online.

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:19,636
In Shadow Hunt, one player is the Phantom, hidden on a city map.

7
00:00:19,656 --> 00:00:21,609
Everyone else hunts together.

8
00:00:21,629 --> 00:00:24,672
On one screen, a pass screen hides each turn.

9
00:00:24,992 --> 00:00:29,024
On set rounds, the Phantom is shown on the map for a moment.

10
00:00:31,267 --> 00:00:35,677
Game of Trades is a build and trade game for three to eight players.

11
00:00:35,697 --> 00:00:39,130
Place settlements and roads, then roll for resources.

12
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:45,693
Online, the host opens a room and shares a five character code.

13
00:00:45,713 --> 00:00:47,431
Friends join from a link.

14
00:00:49,667 --> 00:00:52,960
Each player is sent only what their seat may see.

15
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:56,610
On the left, the Phantom's own screen shows his piece.

16
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:59,585
On the right, a detective's screen does not.

17
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,242
To play, open the link.

18
00:01:03,262 --> 00:01:05,467
There is no account and no install.

19
00:01:05,487 --> 00:01:09,535
The host's browser runs the game, so host with people you trust.

20
00:01:11,767 --> 00:01:14,151
The live link and the code are on screen.

21
00:01:14,171 --> 00:01:15,323
Thanks for watching.

